    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Dirk! Gale! Sophia!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "They're all here..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Let them go."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "Please, keep your voice down. Don't startle them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "Wait here a while, my friends... everything will be alright, once I take care of this little problem. I promise."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Are you talking to them? I doubt they can hear you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "I've never seen symptoms like these... except on the unconscious Joyce."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "The electrodes and the silver liquid... they're connected to their central nervous systems, aren't they?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elena",
        "text": "Dorothy... why is Helen here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "She was worried that she would fail Ferdinand's test. I made a suggestion."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elena",
        "text": "A suggestion... to become a test subject?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elena",
        "text": "Helen was chatting with us just this morning. Now she lies here as conscious as a plank of wood."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "I want to help her, Elena."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "I can feel her pain... just like I feel all of theirs."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "Helen's debts are weighing an entire family down."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "She lives in constant fear... she would take her own life if Ferdinand fired her."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "To stop now would be to deliver them into the hands of merciless fate."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "I can't do something so cruel."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Stop."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Stop with the self-righteousness already, or I can't promise I'll keep my finger off the trigger."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "Your hatred of me stems from your lack of understanding of what you see, and of me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "But I understand you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Like hell you do!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "You understand us so well you'll oh so benevolently give us a chance at a new life. Instead of dying in a Catastrophe or getting eaten by monsters..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "We get to be technically-alive half-corpses in the lab of a big corporation!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Where do I line up to kiss your feet?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "Have you never thought about it, Sonny? Why is it that some people with Oripathy can keep working, while others are forced to leave their homes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Don't need you to tell me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "The day after I got diagnosed, I found my insurance contract and pink slip waiting for me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "The contract was five hundred and sixty-nine pages. The sheet telling me I was fired didn't fill half the paper."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "There aren't a lot of companies out there willing to hire an Infected. We gotta prove we're worth that outrageous insurance premium."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elena",
        "text": "Sigh..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "Don't you think it's unfair?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Kinda goes without saying, doesn't it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "Then you should understand."
    },
