            "delay": 0.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "Everyone deserves a chance, we should all have equal access to opportunity. Differences in talent should not determine one's destiny."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "When someone with talent becomes privileged because of that talent, they are infringing on someone else's interests, undermining fairness."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "I'm among the privileged. And I'm ashamed of my 'luck.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "I wanted to pull you out of the bog before it swallowed you\u2014Dirk, Helen, and you, Sonny."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "I have done all this in the hopes that one day, fortune will smile only upon those who work hard, rather than favor the so-called 'talented'."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "I've spent many years working towards this goal."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "Altering the individual to make it stronger does not solve the problem."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "Those who were born strong can be even stronger with the same alterations, widening the gap even further."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "In order to achieve true equality, I must..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "You wanted to eliminate individual differences?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "The unconscious test subjects... Originium Arts constructs with emotional responses... a massive machine that links them together..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Your experiments... they're..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "I've heard of something like them before, but I thought it was just a mad dream, one that failed a long time ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "Mad dream?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "There's no such thing as 'mad' science. It's just a means to an end."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "We can't ignore or forget the innate differences between individuals, but that doesn't mean we have to be burdened by them forever."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "My technology will allow people to stand before each other as equals, sharing equally the soil, the air, and the rain."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "No longer will their footsteps be stopped by mountains, nor their sight be obstructed by storms."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "They will look into the distance from a place of safety, without having to endure the toil of long journeys and separation from their loved ones."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "Don't you understand the beauty of such a future?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elena",
        "text": "Did I never actually understand...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elena",
        "text": "What exactly were we doing here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "We've been looking for the caster behind the silver constructs."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "We thought it was the individual Pioneers, but we were wrong."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "The caster was all of them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "You have sharp eyes, Dr. Silence."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Director Franks, the future you imagine is just that... your imagination."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "I see something different."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "A skilled Originium Arts caster can destroy a building. Three skilled casters can suppress an entire city block."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "What would happen if you joined the power of ten people, a hundred people, a thousand people?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Nothing under the sun will escape its gaze. The strongest fortress will be little more than a toy that it could crush with a thought."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "As for the people you care about, the ones you call friends... they will never be more than test subjects in the eyes of those who want to harness the technology."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Those who fail will be the lucky ones. They'll be ignored, allowed to live and die on their own."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "A worse fate befalls those who succeed."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "The day their experiment succeeds, they'll be doomed to live under the watchful eyes of corporations and governments."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elena",
        "text": "Olivia... I've never seen you like this..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "This angry."
    },
    {
        "text": "Silence can feel her own anger, like a humming in her mind. Scenes from the past flash across her eyes, as she feels her reason and calm disintegrate."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "You may have changed their destiny, but at what price? They'll lose their freedom forever, their lives no longer their own."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "...I'll protect them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "If it costs my very life."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Killing you, right here, right now just might be best for everyone."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "If that's your consensus..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "Then I won't resist."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elena",
        "text": "Don't lose your head, Sonny!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Lose my head, Doc?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "I'm calmer than I've ever been."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Dorothy Franks... I gotta admit, the picture of the future you're painting has some appeal."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Same as how I almost walked into your lab... you don't know how many times I thought about taking your hand."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "Why didn't you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Because my future... belongs to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "The things you say, not to mention the look of you there... the more welcoming the whole deal, the clearer I see it..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "You're controlling us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy",
        "text": "I..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "It's harder to break out of a sweet dream than a nightmare."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Maybe you're living that dream, Director Franks, but the rest of us are here facing reality."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Doc Silence was right. An experiment like this should never have existed to begin with."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "The lands across our world have given birth to enough madness. This kinda madness oughta get buried deep, and never dug up again."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "Whatever it costs."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sonny",
        "text": "We gotta put a stop to this."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elena",
        "text": "Olivia! Make Sonny listen!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elena",
        "text": "Whatever came of it... Dorothy was only trying to help these people."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elena",
        "text": "Even if I thought she needed to be stopped, to be punished, it shouldn't end like this... not by the ones she truly loved..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ptilopsis",
        "text": "Sonny..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Joyce?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_108_silent_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "You... you're awake?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ptilopsis",
        "text": "Don't hurt Director Franks."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
